      "content": "therapy wont change the fact that i have to do this every single day. it's not just being tired, it's like my whole existence is just a series of chores and obligations. i look at my life and i don't see a future, i just see a loop that never stops. i feel like if i could just stop... if everything would just go quiet for a second, i could finally breathe.",
